{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Draw out</b> — the reason for <b>those who know You</b> — that they are in the supremal degree." "And he mentioned <b>draw out</b> — because His kindness is in the heavens, and משוך serves in connection with something else, namely, <b>draw out Your righteousness</b> to the upright of heart, who have good deeds, even if they are not like those who know HaShem."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:48.509380451Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}